<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Airlines Q3 loss 1.15 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Philippine Airlines Q3 loss 1.15 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Airlines Inc (PAL) reported on Wednesday a net loss in the third quarter ended December 31, 1996 of 1.148 billion pesos.</p>
<p>PAL's fiscal year starts in April. In its disclosure to the Securities and Exchange Commission, the airline did not give a running balance of its financial performance for the first nine months of the year.</p>
